{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up strapped to a chair in a room with no way out. Someone is watching. All you can do is turn and scan every corner. See something strange? <strong>Press red</strong>. Everything looks normal? <strong>Press green</strong>. Either way, the loop repeats \u2014 but never quite the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951680/extras/43fd694e010e5cec1e12355cac77cd9d.poster.avif?t=1756139044\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951680/extras/43fd694e010e5cec1e12355cac77cd9d.webm?t=1756139044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951680/extras/43fd694e010e5cec1e12355cac77cd9d.mp4?t=1756139044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blink your eyes, and reality might show its true face. Some anomalies are obvious. Others are subtle, hiding in the corners until it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951680/extras/a150ddba2e4186ea1fe7d1747c613632.poster.avif?t=1756139044\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951680/extras/a150ddba2e4186ea1fe7d1747c613632.webm?t=1756139044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951680/extras/a150ddba2e4186ea1fe7d1747c613632.mp4?t=1756139044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just about spotting anomalies. It\u2019s the story of <strong>Mike</strong>, trapped in a loop where every run reveals a different side of him. Each floor pulls you higher, closer to the truth\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and yes, there\u2019s also a cat. His name is <strong>Morty</strong>. Sometimes he\u2019s on your side. Sometimes not.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to Expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ anomalies to discover</strong><br>Strange distortions, eerie movements, and impossible changes \u2014 some obvious, some almost invisible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blink mechanic to test reality</strong><br>Close your eyes for a moment and the room may not be the same when you open them again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two-button gameplay</strong><br>Simple choices \u2014 press red or press green \u2014 but each decision pushes the loop forward in unexpected ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claustrophobic POV</strong><br>You are trapped in a chair, unable to move, able only to rotate and scan every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong><br>Each loop uncovers new pieces of the story, leading to different outcomes \u2014 and eventually, the final truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrators with shifting voices</strong><br>Voices that guide, deceive, and change their tone as you climb higher through the floors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morty the Cat</strong><br>Sometimes funny, sometimes terrifying, always unpredictable. Morty can be your ally\u2026 or something else entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951680/extras/98a2399c34c0e2f933f2ad16286c7bba.poster.avif?t=1756139044\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951680/extras/98a2399c34c0e2f933f2ad16286c7bba.webm?t=1756139044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951680/extras/98a2399c34c0e2f933f2ad16286c7bba.mp4?t=1756139044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951680?t=1756139044","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951680/dce7143d3d1ab79828b683c7550e294198592397/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756139044","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951680/67c315ec000680897fb586bac928aa02740ac4e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756139044","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951680/67c315ec000680897fb586bac928aa02740ac4e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756139044","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up strapped to a chair in a room with no way out. Someone is watching. All you can do is turn and scan every corner. See something strange? <strong>Press red</strong>. Everything looks normal? <strong>Press green</strong>. Either way, the loop repeats \u2014 but never quite the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951680/extras/43fd694e010e5cec1e12355cac77cd9d.poster.avif?t=1756139044\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951680/extras/43fd694e010e5cec1e12355cac77cd9d.webm?t=1756139044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=