play</strong><br>Simple choices \u2014 press red or press green \u2014 but each decision pushes the loop forward in unexpected ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claustrophobic POV</strong><br>You are trapped in a chair, unable to move, able only to rotate and scan every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong><br>Each loop uncovers new pieces of the story, leading to different outcomes \u2014 and eventually, the final truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrators with shifting voices</strong><br>Voices that guide, deceive, and change their tone as you climb higher through the floors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morty the Cat</strong><br>Sometimes funny, sometimes terrifying, always unpredictable. Morty can be your ally\u2026 or something else entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951680/extras/98a2399c34c0e2f933f2ad16286c7bba.poster.avif?t=1756139044\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951680/extras/98a2399c34c0e2f933f2ad16286c7bba.webm?t=1756139044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951680/extras/98a2399c34c0e2f933f2ad16286c7bba.mp4?t=1756139044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Swytapp Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951680/c267e560d5e7d4bbe3c37256eb69cea3259a67f7/header.jpg?t=1756139044","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"b